  "policy": "Freeze model and feature version. No training, threshold changes or source selection based on predictions. Count detection abstentions as incorrect in all-attempt accuracy. Transformed versions are correlated stress trials, not independent videos or new signers. In-plane roll is not a 3D camera-angle test. Source labels come from dictionary metadata, not inferred predictions.",
  "limitations": "Convenience web sample with dictionary-provided labels. Sign variants and senses can differ. Exact hashes and known source URLs were checked against all fitting/selection/evaluation clips. Distinct video does not prove distinct signer; no claim of signer-independent sampling. Synthetic conditions share source clips, so do not treat their total as independent sample size. No model fitting or threshold changes. All newly evaluated clips must remain outside future fit data unless explicitly reclassified as development data."
